<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Diffusion–Low-Rank Hybrid Reconstruction for Sparse-View Medical Imaging</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zongyin Deng<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Qing Zhou<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Yuhao Fang<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Zijian Wang<sup id="id4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2</span></sup>, Yao Lu<sup id="id5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Ye Zhang<sup id="id6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,3</span></sup>, and Chun Li<sup id="id7" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,∗</span></sup>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
